# The Library takes the sidebar's place: the favorites under it get no pointer (their tooltips
# showed through, 8 Nov 2026), and come back when it closes.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
from://open?url=${PAGE}?n=fav
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
from://action/favoriteTab
from://action/viewMedia
expect-log library covers the tab list
